  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Some new strings have been added that reference 12 hour and 24 hour time as \"Hour Modes\" and I think a much better term for the English string would be **\"Hour Format\"** or **\"Clock Format\"**. This is a much more universally understood term for choosing how clocks display the time.\n\nExamples of strings using this term (not extensive):\n\n#76020 \"Hour **Mode**\" (Format)\n\n#76044 \"Change the clock to 24 hour **mode**\" (format)\n\n#76018 \"Change the clock hour **mode**[...]\" (format)",
